// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (which is gitignored) and fill in your key.
// Get a Gemini API key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
//
// IMPORTANT: '//' inside an xcconfig value is treated as the start of a comment.
// Gemini keys start with "AIza" and don't contain '/', so this is normally fine,
// but if your key ever contained '//' you'd need to split it across vars.

GEMINI_API_KEY = your_gemini_api_key_here
